OL,3,GNEWSACouncil moves to quash shopping
OL,4,Acentre rumours
OL,5,
OL,6,FCouncil bosses have hit out at online
OL,7,Frumours about the future of a derelict
OL,8,Fshopping centre, insisting "no
OL,9,Fdecisions have been made" about the
OL,10,Ffinal redevelopment.
OL,12,FWychavon District Council said
OL,13,F"misinformation" was circulating on
OL,14,Fsocial media suggesting the Riverside
OL,15,Fshopping centre site in Evesham would
OL,16,Fbe filled with high-rise flats or only
OL,17,Fsocial housing.
OL,23,APub: 15-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,357,350,200,160,0,100
