OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,$A(W)
OL,3,GNEWSACouncil moves to quash shopping
OL,4,Acentre rumours
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe authority said the redevelopment
OL,7,Fwould still include retail and leisure,
OL,8,Fand no final decisions have been made
OL,9,Fabout the future mix of housing, once
OL,10,Fthe building is knocked down.
OL,12,FCouncillor Richard Morris, the leader,
OL,13,Fsaid: "I would encourage people to use
OL,14,Fthe information we publish to stay
OL,15,Finformed, and not rely on speculation."
